 R←Test_SendEmail_53(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;rc;msg;log;text
⍝ Missing "To", "Subject" and "Body": nothing is sent
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 ∆SERVER.Defaults
 (rc msg log text)←∆Send ⎕NEW SMTP.MailParameters
 →T.PassesIf ¯1=rc
 →T.PassesIf'Missing: "To","Subject","Body"'≡msg
 →T.PassesIf 0=≢∆SERVER.Commands

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
